| $3,000+ | Statement + brushed texture | [Brushed Finish Channel, 14k YG](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/mens-brushed-finish-diamond-channel-engagement-ring-in-14k-yellow-gold-1-4-ct-tw-item-146888?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) | $3,052 | Matte/sparkle contrast; most fashion-forward |
| **What this means** | Match tier to lifestyle | Not just budget | Setting only unless channel | Add stone cost for solitaire settings |

**Verdict:** The $2,000–$2,500 range is the sweet spot. At this budget you either get a complete channel set ring with 1/3 ct tw already included, or a platinum solitaire setting at the daily-wear standard. Below $1,500 you are in solitaire-setting-only territory — add a stone and total cost lands around $1,500–$2,200. Above $3,000, the premium goes toward 18k metal or brushed-finish design — both defensible for the right buyer.

